Title1":null,"Summary":null,"Summary1":null,"Image":"lessons_s3_l25","Sort":26},{"id":51,"StageID":3,"Number":0,"Title":"诵读规则（塔朱维德）","Title1":null,"Summary":null,"Summary1":null,"Image":"lessons_s3_l0","Sort":1},{"id":52,"StageID":3,"Number":-1,"Title":"按塔朱维德规则朗读","Title1":null,"Summary":null,"Summary1":null,"Image":"lessons_s3_l-1","Sort":2},{"id":53,"StageID":1,"Number":17,"Title":"拟音符号（Tanween）","Title1":null,"Summary":"Tanween（拟音符号）是指在 Fatha（ ）、Kasra（ ）或 Dhamma（ ）上再加一个同样的符号，发出带 “n” 音的读音。它们分别叫做 Fathatan、Kasratan 和 Dammatan，是三种带鼻音的读法。本课将帮助您正确识别并朗读带有 Tanween 拟音符号的阿拉伯字母。请从右边的第一个字母开始，点击听发音。自己多练习几次，直到您可以把字母的写法和它的 Tanween 与发音正确对应起来，然后再继续学习下一个字母。","Summary1":null,"Image":"lessons_s1_l17","Sort":6},{"id":54,"StageID":2,"Number":5,"Title":"连续诵读古兰经 整部《古兰经》","Title1":null,"Summary":"本课将帮助您连续朗读整章《古兰经》内容，提升整体发音的流畅度。  课程涵盖《古兰经》全部 114 章（苏拉）。您可以点击页面上方的章节号（苏拉）、节号（阿耶）、页码或卷数（Juz），跳转至指定位置。（请注意：本系统所用页码与《古兰经》印刷版保持一致。）","Summary1":null,"Image":"lessons_s2_l5","Sort":19},{"id":55,"StageID":2,"Number":6,"Title":"阿拉伯语《古兰经》 完整版《古兰经》","Title1":null,"Summary":null,"Summary1":null,"Image":"lessons_s2_l6","Sort":20},{"id":56,"StageID":4,"Number":1,"Title":"Nouns and Adjectives","Title1":null,"Summary":null,"Summary1":null,"Image":"lessons_s4_l1","Sort":1},{"id":57,"StageID":4,"Number":2,"Title":"Plurals","Title1":null,"Summary":null,"Summary1":null,"Image":"lessons_s4_l2","Sort":2},{"id":58,"StageID":4,"Number":3,"Title":"The Declension of Nouns","Title1":null,"Summary":null,"Summary1":null,"Image":"lessons_s4_l3","Sort":3},{"id":59,"StageID":4,"Number":4,"Title":"Prepositions","Title1":null,"Summary":null,"Summary1":null,"Image":"lessons_s4_l4","Sort":4},{"id":60,"StageID":4,"Number":5,"Title":"First-Person Singular Genitive Suffix and Separation Pronoun","Title1":null,"Summary":null,"Summary1":null,"Image":"lessons_s4_l5","Sort":5},{"id":61,"StageID":4,"Number":6,"Title":"Demonstratives","Title1":null,"Summary":null,"Summary1":null,"Image":"lessons_s4_l6","Sort":6},{"id":62,"StageID":4,"Numb